    {
      "source": "Turns the <a href=\"AggregationExpression.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>AggregationExpression</code></a> into a <code>Document</code> within the given\n<a href=\"AggregationOperationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>AggregationOperationContext</code></a>.",
      "translation": "将给定的 <a href=\"AggregationExpression.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>AggregationExpression</code></a> 转换为 <code>Document</code>，该转换在指定的 <a href=\"AggregationOperationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>AggregationOperationContext</code></a> 中进行。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "never null.",
      "translation": "永不为空。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The <a href=\"AggregationExpression.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>expressions</code></a> <a href=\"#toDocument(org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation.AggregationOperationContext)\"><code>toDocument(AggregationOperationContext)</code></a> method is called during\nthe mapping process to obtain the mapped, ready to use representation that can be handed over to the driver as part\nof an <a href=\"AggregationOperation.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>pipleine stage</code></a>.",
      "translation": "在映射过程中，会调用<a href=\"AggregationExpression.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>expressions</code></a><a href=\"#toDocument(org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation.AggregationOperationContext)\"><code>toDocument(AggregationOperationContext)</code></a>方法，以获取可用于作为<a href=\"AggregationOperation.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>pipeline stage</code></a>的一部分传递给驱动程序的已映射且可立即使用的表示形式。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<small>Copyright © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>. All rights reserved.</small>",
      "translation": "<small>版权所有 © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>。保留所有权利。</small>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Create an <a href=\"AggregationExpression.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>AggregationExpression</code></a> out of a given <a href=\"../../MongoExpression.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb\"><code>MongoExpression</code></a> to ensure the resulting\n<a href=\"../../MongoExpression.html#toDocument()\"><code>Document</code></a> is mapped against the <a href=\"AggregationOperationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>AggregationOperationContext</code></a>. <br/>\nIf the given expression is already an <a href=\"AggregationExpression.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>AggregationExpression</code></a> the very same instance is returned.",
      "translation": "将给定的<a href=\"../../MongoExpression.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb 中的接口\"><code>MongoExpression</code></a>转换为一个<a href=\"AggregationExpression.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation 中的接口\"><code>AggregationExpression</code></a>，以确保生成的<a href=\"../../MongoExpression.html#toDocument()\"><code>Document</code></a>能够映射到<a href=\"AggregationOperationContext.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation 中的接口\"><code>AggregationOperationContext</code></a>。<br/>\n如果给定的表达式本身就是一个<a href=\"AggregationExpression.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation 中的接口\"><code>AggregationExpression</code></a>，则直接返回该实例。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Create an <a href=\"AggregationExpression.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>AggregationExpression</code></a> out of a given <a href=\"../../MongoExpression.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb\"><code>MongoExpression</code></a> to ensure the resulting\n<a href=\"../../MongoExpression.html#toDocument()\"><code>Document</code></a> is mapped against the <a href=\"AggregationOperationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>AggregationOperationContext</code></a>.",
      "translation": "创建一个<a href=\"AggregationExpression.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation 中的接口\"><code>AggregationExpression</code></a>，基于给定的<a href=\"../../MongoExpression.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb 中的接口\"><code>MongoExpression</code></a>，以确保生成的<a href=\"../../MongoExpression.html#toDocument()\"><code>Document</code></a>能够映射到<a href=\"AggregationOperationContext.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation 中的接口\"><code>AggregationOperationContext</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Obtain the as is (unmapped) representation of the <a href=\"AggregationExpression.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>AggregationExpression</code></a>. Use\n<a href=\"#toDocument(org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation.AggregationOperationContext)\"><code>toDocument(AggregationOperationContext)</code></a> with a matching <a href=\"AggregationOperationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>context</code></a> to\nengage domain type mapping including field name resolution.",
      "translation": "获取 `<a href=\"AggregationExpression.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>AggregationExpression</code></a>` 的 as is（未映射）表示形式。使用与匹配的 <a href=\"AggregationOperationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>context</code></a> 配合\n<a href=\"#toDocument(org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation.AggregationOperationContext)\"><code>toDocument(AggregationOperationContext)</code></a>，以启用领域类型映射（包括字段名解析）。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Obtain the as is (unmapped) representation of the <a href=\"AggregationExpression.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>AggregationExpression</code></a>.",
      "translation": "获取<a href=\"AggregationExpression.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation 包中的接口\"><code>AggregationExpression</code></a>的 as is（未映射）表示形式。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"../../MongoExpression.html#toDocument()\">toDocument</a></code> in interface <code><a href=\"../../MongoExpression.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb\">MongoExpression</a></code>",
      "translation": "接口 <code><a href=\"../../MongoExpression.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb 中的接口\">MongoExpression</a></code> 中的 <code><a href=\"../../MongoExpression.html#toDocument()\">toDocument</a></code>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
